# (BERLIN, the Lead's FORGET: the user's design; 1.3: PERFORM's keys are all effects, so the top key (G5, w15: key 26)
# no longer forgets: it is Crush's. FORGET is SAVE tapped in PERFORM, and stays on the USB link (LK_FORGET): the
# Lead forgets its ideas and its theme ("LEAD FORGOTTEN", a card), nothing else changes
wait 500
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
tap SEL
wait 300
expect view 17
said PERFORM ON
expect litkey26 1
key w15 down
wait 100
said Crush
expect pheld 67108864
expect card 0
key w15 up
wait 100
# SAVE tapped in PERFORM: forgotten, PERFORM kept, nothing saved
tap SAVE
wait 200
said LEAD FORGOTTEN
expect card 1
expect view 17
said_none SAVED
wait 4000
link hello
wait 100
link forget
wait 100
expect card 1
expect mutes 0
expect view 17
tap ENV
wait 300
expect view 1
said PERFORM OFF
